    "note": "Teaches Ch. 43 Hit 1 (core: CD34⁺ enumeration and minimum dose) and the general principles of Hit 6 (DMSO, slow controlled-rate freezing, nitrogen storage) plus the Figure 43 memory anchor. The reviewer’s 2.5 × 10⁶/kg minimum differs from the ≥ 2 × 10⁶/kg cited in the source read (flag rv-cd34-dose). Pending: CFU assay timing (Trap 3), the exact freezing ramp and storage temperature, and DMSO reinfusion toxicity (Hit 14, Trap 4)."
