  "prerequisites": [],
  "objectives": [
    "Calculate a CD34⁺ cell dose per kilogram from a product count.",
    "Compare a dose with the minimum threshold for autologous transplantation and recognize poor mobilization.",
    "Outline cryopreservation of hematopoietic progenitor cells with DMSO and slow controlled-rate freezing."
  ],
